  "details": "Description\n\nwhen inviting friends to my instances my avatar will not show up to them the way i customized it, instead they see the default state of my avatar while i still see my own customizations. This is fixed by me rejoining the instance.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nWhen i invite friends they often see my avatar in its default state, its fixed by me rejoining.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-18_11-00-28.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_646e8299-e1d0-4eb8-ba01-4a31c730d253/1/file)",
